Giant Head is an [[Elite]] enemy found exclusively in [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Giant Head}}

For the first 4 ({{Asc|18|3}}) turns, it has a 50/50 chance to use either {{Int|Giant Head|Count}} or {{Int|Giant Head|Glare}}. Cannot use either move three times in a row.

Afterwards, it repeats {{Int|Giant Head|It Is Time}} for the rest of combat.

== Found With ==

=== Act 3 ===
* Solo

== Dialogue ==

As it counts down to using {{Int|Giant Head|It Is Time}}:
<blockquote>
<i>{{TS|ironclad|up|4..}}</i>
<br>
<i>{{TS|ironclad|up|3..}}</i>  (Starts here on {{Asc|18|Ascension}})
<br>
<i>{{TS|ironclad|up|2..}}</i>
<br>
<i>{{TS|ironclad|up|1..}}</i>
<br>
</blockquote>

